{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 842.0, 595.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [27.741763134461262, 39.51171875, 544.3383793410508, 118.53515625], "text": "PwC ME: Home for the region's top talent", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [680.2603515625, 74.055419921875, 783.3724609375, 138.610595703125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [27.741763134461262, 156.6183879093199, 791.0151380231522, 199.59228515625], "text": "We are a diverse community of solvers who come together to build trust and and create sustained outcomes. We solve important problems and support one another as we grow, develop and build fulfilling careers. We thrive in uncertainty, operate with integrity and leverage the diverse perspectives of our teams. We're innovative, resilient change agents who are human-led and tech-powered.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [90.90146484375, 294.449462890625, 325.16494140625, 342.386474609375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [131.1513671875, 345.117431640625, 284.9150390625, 505.546630859375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [405.6295636687444, 317.54638671875, 669.5512021371327, 340.20751953125], "text": "If you're looking for a place", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [500.8512911843277, 360.25390625, 755.7756010685663, 381.171875], "text": "that fuels your ambition to", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [425.873552983081, 402.411838790932, 605.0703472840605, 421.55517578125], "text": "make a difference,", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [398.88156723063224, 446.62468513853906, 783.5173642030276, 494.58438287153655], "text": "that matches your curiosity with continuous learning opportunities and reimagines ways of working to enable you to lead a more balanced life - then you're a future PwCer.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [818.5654296875, 564.49462890625, 824.3212890625, 570.88623046875], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}, {"bbox": [31.24609375, 568.022670025189, 139.78515625, 582.7978515625], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}], "doc_id": "PWC_opportunity_of_lifetime.pdf", "page_index": 1, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/PWC_opportunity_of_lifetime.pdf", "source": "marker"}